[node name="Player" type="CharacterBody3D" parent="."]
# Spawn moved off the level origin: the origin put the player behind a fence, so the
# third-person camera either jammed on it or framed his backside with his legs occluded.
# tools/find_spawn.gd probed 548 candidate spots and this one has 6 m of clear space in
# all 24 directions at knee and chest height.
